  "title": "Sweet and Spicy Pumpkin Turkey Pasta",
  "description": "A ground turkey pasta dish served in a sweet and spicy pumpkin sauce is rich, creamy, filling, and fragrant, a great meal for a cold night.",
  "authors": [
    "Joel Hernandez"
  ],
